                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "The container is a pack of the `t_constants` kind with `referred == true` (a combination no\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "other pack has). Its `constants` are ordered references — one int each, holding a sub-pack\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "index — to one sub-pack per chain entry, listed wire end first. `nested_max` records\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "what the chain was declared on: 1 field, 2 pack, 3 connection.\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "What each entry is, is read from the sub-pack's `id`. Existing `DataType` values are\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "reused as tags: in this position none of them can mean a data type, and the run is\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "contiguous, so `t_int16 <= id <= t_bool` identifies a chain entry in one test. The\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "sub-pack's `name` (`Zstd`, `ChaCha20`, `ToStream`, …) is for humans; the tag carries meaning.\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "`t_bool` (65531) — trim: ToStream. On a leg it names, the\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "RECEIVER stops unwrapping at this depth and takes raw bytes. `t_int8` (65530) — trim: FromStream. On a leg it names, the\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "SENDER supplies raw bytes at this depth. `t_binary` (65529) — stage, role compression. `t_uint8` (65528) — stage, role cipher. `t_int16` (65527) — stage, no role: a plain byte transform.\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "A stage sub-pack's own constants are its full parameter list — a value for each\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "design-time parameter, null for each one to be injected at runtime.\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "A trim sub-pack's constants are the endpoints it applies to, one int each: the\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "connection index, positive when the sender is that connection's Left host, bitwise-inverted\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "(`~idx`) when it is the Right one.\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "A trim transforms nothing — it marks a position. Stages closer to the wire than the cut\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "still run on that leg; everything beyond it, including the pack's own serialization, does\n" +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "not, and the payload crosses as opaque bytes. Every other leg runs the chain in full." },
